{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/846944-mekhet-devotion-idea","id":846944,"title":"Mekhet Devotion Idea","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-13T22:14:21-07:00","id":846944,"title":"Mekhet Devotion Idea","content":"I have an idea for a devotion were Mekhet use mirrors to travel or store messages.<br /> <br /> Mirror Travel<br /> <br /> (Obfuscate \u2022\u2022\u2022, Auspex \u2022)<br /> <br /> This Devotion grants a Mekhet who has mastered the ability to become nothing to erase there reflection from a mirror and step into the place of their reflection. This allows them to travel into a mirror world like our own but broken and come out of another mirror. When in the mirror world you are traveling in a world that is the reverse of our own but the longer you stay the faster your mirror self might find you and kill.<br /> <br /> Cost: 2 Vitae<br /> Dice Pool: None<br /> Action: Instant<br /> <br /> Any suggestions on how I can make this better ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 03-14-2016, 05:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T05:19:02-07:00","id":847019,"title":"","content":"I don't understand the most of this power. What does the Mirror self do? How does him finding and killing you work? What's the point to go into the Mirror realm at all?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T16:23:56-07:00","id":847381,"title":"","content":"You can use it to go into a mirror and come out of another mirror","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T19:01:19-07:00","id":847465,"title":"","content":"Seems too vaguely defined; it introduces an entire new realm of existence and a unique danger in this realm, in three sentences. Seems like it is more suited to be a chapter-length series of devotions, starting from a simple message-sending, something like &quot;Projecting your shadow into a mirror, you can order it to relay a short sentence to any one other mirror you have previously seen,&quot; and then only later (maybe requiring Auspex V) projecting your own senses or body through the mirror. <br /> You need more information on how long they can stay in the mirror, how fast travel is, how do they see other mirrors, can they identify places without mirrors, can they see through mirrors they don't know of, how do they know which direction a certain mirror is, can they see others travelling in mirrors, can they interact with others travelling in mirrors? Do others know about this realm? <br /> You need to theorize on the mirror-self. What do they represent? What are a few theories on where they come from? Maybe link it to the 5-part soul of the Mekhet. But then, what if others with Auspex use the devotion? <br /> You need to stat up the mirror-self. How can it find you? How fast does it move? What powers does it have? <br /> <br /> What you have written up is a great hook for a story about someone who doesn't know what they're doing finding a magic mirror that allows them to travel through mirrors. It doesn't seem sufficient for rules allowing characters to do this regularly. Even in the story-hook version, you need to slowly reveal more about how mirror-travel works.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2291-gwyn-chan-r-gwyll","name":"Gwyn chan 'r Gwyll","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T19:32:19-07:00","id":847477,"title":"","content":"There is an interesting discipline from 1ed, Ars Speculorum, that allows &quot;mirrorportation&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1866-ophion","name":"Ophion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{